WEBVTT

00:38:28.579 --> 00:38:31.496
which were actually going to hurt their
payment for participating in the study.

00:38:31.913 --> 00:38:33.371
And we found that, lo and behold,

00:38:33.371 --> 00:38:37.079
after we just got fans to think
about how they might root for

00:38:37.079 --> 00:38:39.538
a different team if they had been
born in a different city,

00:38:39.954 --> 00:38:43.746
that was enough to get them to show
less animosity toward fans of

00:38:43.746 --> 00:38:45.996
the opposing team, which
I thought was amazing.

00:38:45.996 --> 00:38:47.621
And this did not make it into the book.

00:38:47.621 --> 00:38:53.246
But we just finished a couple of
experiments with with gun control

00:38:53.246 --> 00:38:57.746
and gun rights advocates where we found
that the same process worked for them.

00:38:58.371 --> 00:39:03.746
That if we got somebody who is extremely
concerned about about gun safety,